  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-alpha.7: the typed playback lane (Timeline<T>.Seek(...).Apply(...) over BakedLane measured tables) is the only playback surface; the frame view slims to ushort positions under a single 65,535-tick cap with ClipLength and WithinClip on Frame; MeasuredLanes shares tables across set binds with the TickPurity.WindowConstant opt-in fill. The Timeline.Rows facade, kernel catalog, cycle, and game tick are removed.",
